TextRoom keyboard shortcuts:

F1 - Help screen
F11 - Fullscreen on/off
Escape - Quit or exit fullscreen (depends on current active window state)
Alt+H - About
Alt+M - Minimize TextRoom
Alt+Q - Quit
Alt+P - Options

Alt+N - New
Alt+O - Open
Alt+S - Save
Alt+Shift+S - Save As

Alt+X - Cut
Alt+C - Copy
Alt+V - Paste
Alt+A - Select All
Alt+Z - Undo (Alt+Shift+Z to Redo)

Alt+W - Select font
Alt+B - Bold
Alt+I - Italic
Alt+U - Underline
Alt+Up / Alt+Down - Increase / decrease font size

Shift+F4 - Go back to cursor position
Alt+D - Insert date
Alt+T - Insert time
Alt+F - Find
F3 - Find Next
Shift+F3 - Find previous
